 "Clear workspace": "清空工作區",
 "This removes every module and connection from the current program. You can undo it with Ctrl/⌘+Z.": "這會移除當前程式中的所有模組和連線。你可以用 Ctrl/⌘+Z 撤銷。",
 "Opened “{name}”. Your previous program was kept under Open → Saved programs.": "已開啟“{name}”。你之前的程式保留在“開啟 → 已儲存的程式”中。",
 "{name} copy": "{name} 副本",
 "Duplicated. You are now editing the copy; the original is under Saved programs.": "已複製。你現在編輯的是副本；原程式儲存在“已儲存的程式”中。",
 "Saved “{name}” in this browser.": "已將“{name}”儲存到此瀏覽器。",
 "Browser storage is unavailable or full. Use Export to download the program instead.": "瀏覽器儲存不可用或已滿。請改用“匯出”下載程式。",
 "Exported program file.": "已匯出程式檔案。",
 "Import failed.": "匯入失敗。",
 " {n} problem was repaired or skipped.": " 有 {n} 個問題已被修復或跳過。",
 " {n} problems were repaired or skipped.": " 有 {n} 個問題已被修復或跳過。",
 "Imported “{name}” from {source}.{extra}": "已從{source}匯入“{name}”。{extra}",
 "file “{name}”": "檔案“{name}”",
 "share code": "分享程式碼",
 "That file is too large (limit 8 MB).": "該檔案過大（上限 8 MB）。",
 "Paste a share code first.": "請先貼上分享程式碼。",
 "New program.": "已新建程式。",
 "Created compound “{name}”. Open it from the inspector.": "已建立複合體“{name}”。可在檢查器中開啟它。",
 "Saved “{name}” to your library. It is available in other programs.": "已將“{name}”儲存到你的庫。其他程式中也可使用。",
 "Could not write to browser storage; export the program to keep this compound.": "無法寫入瀏覽器儲存；請匯出程式以保留此複合體。",
 "Connection to {dst} references a missing port “{port}”.": "到 {dst} 的連線引用了不存在的埠“{port}”。",
 "Incompatible connection {a}.{b} → {c}.{d}.": "不相容的連線 {a}.{b} → {c}.{d}。",
 "Feedback loop ({names}) is stabilised by a delaying module; the closing connection delivers one tick late.": "反饋環路（{names}）由帶延遲的模組穩定；閉合連線會晚一個節拍送達。",
 "Unbounded cycle ({names} → …). No Delay, Register, State or timing module breaks the loop, so the closing connection {a} → {b} is blocked. Insert a Delay to make it a feedback loop.": "無界迴圈（{names} → …）。沒有“延遲”“暫存器”“狀態”或計時模組可打斷該環路，因此閉合連線 {a} → {b} 已被阻止。請插入“延遲”使其成為反饋環路。",
 "Runaway protection: too many pending timed events. Execution was halted; press Stop and check delays or feedback loops.": "失控保護：待處理的定時事件過多，執行已中止。請按“停止”，並檢查延遲或反饋環路。",
 "Runaway protection: too many evaluations in one tick. Execution was halted.": "失控保護：單個節拍內求值次數過多，執行已中止。",
 "Runaway protection: excessive signal propagation in one tick. Execution was halted.": "失控保護：單個節拍內訊號傳播過多，執行已中止。",
 "Output “{port}” is not a finite number.": "輸出“{port}”不是有限數值。",
 "Input “{label}” received a value that cannot be converted to {type}.": "輸入“{label}”收到了無法轉換為 {type} 的值。",
 "{name}: waiting because upstream module “{up}” failed.": "{name}：因上游模組“{up}”失敗而等待。",
 "Waiting: upstream module “{name}” failed.": "等待中：上游模組“{name}”失敗。",
 "Compound definition “{id}” is missing.": "複合體定義“{id}”缺失。",
 "Compounds are nested too deeply (limit 8).": "複合體巢狀過深（上限 8 層）。",
 "Unknown module type.": "未知的模組型別。",
 "Module no longer exists.": "模組已不存在。",
 "Audio: Web Audio is not available in this browser.": "音訊：此瀏覽器不支援 Web Audio。",
 "Audio: sound is locked until you interact with the page. Press Run or Step.": "音訊：在你與頁面互動之前，聲音處於鎖定狀態。請按“執行”或“單步”。",
 "Haptic: this device or browser does not support vibration.": "觸覺：此裝置或瀏覽器不支援振動。",
 "Notify: notification permission is “{state}”. Use the inspector to request it.": "通知：通知許可權為“{state}”。請在檢查器中請求許可權。",
 "Waiting for camera permission…": "正在等待攝像頭許可權…",
 "Camera API unavailable. It needs a camera and a secure context (https or localhost).": "攝像頭 API 不可用。它需要攝像頭和安全環境（https 或 localhost）。",
 "Camera live. Frames are processed locally and never stored.": "攝像頭已啟用。畫面僅在本地處理，絕不儲存。",
 "Camera permission was denied or blocked. Allow it in the browser’s site settings and press Run again.": "攝像頭許可權被拒絕或被阻止。請在瀏覽器的網站設定中允許，然後再次按“執行”。",
 "No camera was found on this device.": "此裝置上未找到攝像頭。",
 "Camera error: {n}.": "攝像頭錯誤：{n}。",
 "Waiting for microphone permission…": "正在等待麥克風許可權…",
 "Microphone API unavailable. It needs a microphone and a secure context (https or localhost).": "麥克風 API 不可用。它需要麥克風和安全環境（https 或 localhost）。",
 "Microphone live. Only level and pitch are used; no audio is recorded.": "麥克風已啟用。只使用音量和音高，不會錄製任何音訊。",
 "Microphone permission was denied or blocked. Allow it in the browser’s site settings and press Run again.": "麥克風許可權被拒絕或被阻止。請在瀏覽器的網站設定中允許，然後再次按“執行”。",
 "No microphone was found on this device.": "此裝置上未找到麥克風。",
 "Microphone error: {n}.": "麥克風錯誤：{n}。",
 "This browser has no device orientation API.": "此瀏覽器沒有裝置方向 API。",
